<title>GERMANY: Allianz says could take CL stake.</title>
<headline>Allianz says could take CL stake.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurer Allianz AG Holding has no plans to take over France's Credit Lyonnais, but would be interested in taking a minority holding, Allianz chairman Henning Schulte-Noelle said.</p>
<p>Schulte-Noelle told the Boersen-Zeitung in an interview that speculation that the insurer planned a takeover was wrong.</p>
<p>However he added that Allianz would consider taking a small stake to give strength to its strategic cooperation. He said such a stake would be &quot;notably below 10 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
